Pablo,

The function WarpRefMesh will allow you to take a 3D mesh and warp it into the reference specimen. Then, in plotTangentSpace (which is the current PCA function), if you include Mesh = … in the arguments, it will take the reference-warped mesh and mesh it along the PC axes.

The geomorph user guide has instructions.

Dean

